<Slide style={{ background: '#0B1020', padding: 60 }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'flex-end' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>④ 知识库与附件：文件里的字也搜得到</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>06 / 功能 4</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 1, background: 'rgba(34,211,238,0.4)', marginTop: 14 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 22, marginTop: 22 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 700 }}>
            <Image src="assets/graph.png" style={{ width: 700, height: 300, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155' }} />
            <Image src="assets/settings-ocr.png" style={{ width: 700, height: 120, objectFit: 'cover', objectPosition: 'top', borderRadius: 8, border: '1px solid #334155', marginTop: 14 }} />
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 438, gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>笔记与日程双向链接</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>笔记里能引用条目，条目详情里能跳回相关笔记 —— 不用在两套系统里各存一份。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>附件正文进索引</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>PDF / Word 抽出文字一并索引；截图和照片走本地 OCR（离线），也可以选云端视觉模型。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>图谱看关联</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>哪条笔记连着哪些日程、哪些课程，一张图看清楚，点节点就跳过去。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ padding: 14, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #22D3EE' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>按课程 / 标签归类</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 8 }}>同一门课的笔记、作业、考试自动聚在一起，复习时不用到处翻。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ marginTop: 12, padding: 16, background: '#151B33', borderRadius: 8, borderLeft: '3px solid #4F46E5' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#E2E8F0', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
            <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#22D3EE' }}>方便在哪</span>
            ：以前找资料只能靠文件名回忆 —— "那份实验报告里好像提过这个参数"。现在直接搜那个词，命中的是 PDF 里的那一段话。
        </Text>
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', position: 'absolute', left: 60, top: 670 }}>个人工作台 · v0.2.0</Text>
</Slide>
